{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は沈金でした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストはCharisma.comさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレでクセになる楽曲で\nもっと知りたい！って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてくれてありがとうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムフリー聴取機能やシェアラジオという\n問題発言も拡散されてしまう\n中田からしたら恐ろしい機能が\n始まっちゃってる今回の沈金も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も恐れずいろんな発言してますが\n何も悪気はないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もお楽しみにね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中の『EX大衆』\n読んでくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は２つの記事で載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙に名前が2つも！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その内のひとつ、\n16thシングルにサンエトの新曲が収録される\nという情報解禁までされちゃってます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜきいなかだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV撮影の裏側を密着していただいので\n16thシングルが待ちきれない！って方は\nこれをじっくり見て\n気持ちを落ち着かせてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日こそ乃木中でタンバリンやります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週だ！今週だ！って2回やりましたが\n3度目の正直ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/16/1535822/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}